== ROOT CAUSE (measured, not assumed) ===================================
MECHANISM: the P5 finding is a REPRO ARTIFACT, not a WEB-runtime defect.
The original repro never reached the SELECTED state: its 4th click
(640,380) is WORLD GROUND, and the shipped select route is the PANEL uid
row only (defense_rows_ui.gd:153 b.pressed -> panel.select_defense; world
LMB rides PRESS "confirm" and does nothing unarmed — defense_panel
PRESS map). No selection => the driver's correct answer IS hide_ring =>
"zero ring-band pixels" was TRUE but not a product bug.

